WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.210
The first talk on my
list is from 2010.

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.990
Barcelona, Human Brain Mapping.

3
00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.590
White matter, and what
musical training does to it.

4
00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:12.170
Two years later, TEDx Abu Dhabi.

5
00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:15.010
Music, neuroscience, and education,

6
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.690
and what we can learn
from the spaces between.

7
00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:22.490
In 2015, I took NeuRace to the
Hintsa Performance Clinic in Geneva.

8
00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:24.190
Then, teachers.

9
00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:27.790
Motivation and the adolescent
brain, in Jacksonville.

10
00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:32.450
Twice at TCEA in Austin,
on AI in education,

11
00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:34.610
the skepticism, and the safety.

12
00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:38.210
ZoneSight at IEEE EDUCON, in London.

13
00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:42.600
In 2025, I went to Capitol Hill
with workforce-development leaders,

14
00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:46.490
to talk about workforce technology
and the jobs coming next.

15
00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:50.050
And this year, a keynote
in Porto Alegre, Brazil.

16
00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:54.410
Building AI innovation with
healthcare, not simply for it.

17
00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:57.030
I do keynotes, panels, and workshops.

18
00:00:57.340 --> 00:00:59.970
If you're putting something
together, reach out through the site.
